      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "ruA798bWT4beK0Vc",
      "img": "icons/creatures/unholy/demon-hairy-winged-pink.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>At the start of each round while the hypercube is present, roll a [[/roll d10]]. On a 7 or higher, the hypercube teleports to a square of one ally’s choice within 10 squares and is hidden. While the hypercube is hidden, Psionics is the only skill that can be applied to a test made to find it.</p>",
